            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[If the perimeter of triangle ABC is 40 cm and the side is twice as large as the base of the triangle, then AB and BC are 16 cm and AC is 8 cm, respectively.]]></content>
